andrewbrownrd/polymarket-simmer-fastloop  1.0.7 -> 1.0.8
change_type: instructions+code   changelog: - Added pre-caching ("Ignition") to scan and cache upcoming fast market IDs, enabling trading during brief API blackout windows at market open. - Documentation updated to describe new pre-caching feature and its role in ensuring uninterrupted trade execution. - No code or strategy changes; only new feature documentation and a metadata file (_meta.json) were added.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
+ - **Pre-Caching (Ignition)**: On every run, the skill scans and caches upcoming market IDs to disk (`fast_markets_cache.json`). At market open, the Simmer API briefly hides the market — the skill uses the cache to execute trades during this "API blackout" window, ensuring no opportunity is missed.

